§ `s 4 -- unregistered assurances are inadmissible, not void`

#ASSERT `the assurance is within this Act` `an unregistered conveyance of common-law land`
#ASSERT `the assurance is within this Act` `a registered conveyance of common-law land`
#ASSERT NOT `the assurance is within this Act` `a conveyance of land under the Land Titles Act`
#ASSERT NOT `the assurance is within this Act` `a conveyance of land in Johor`
#ASSERT NOT `the assurance is within this Act` `a three-year lease with possession`
#ASSERT `the assurance is within this Act` `an unregistered mortgage registered under the 1886 Ordinance`
#ASSERT NOT `a court will admit the assurance as evidence of title` `an unregistered conveyance of common-law land`
#ASSERT `a court will admit the assurance as evidence of title` `a registered conveyance of common-law land`
#ASSERT `a court will admit the assurance as evidence of title` `a conveyance of land under the Land Titles Act`
#ASSERT `a court will admit the assurance as evidence of title` `a conveyance of land in Johor`
#ASSERT `a court will admit the assurance as evidence of title` `a three-year lease with possession`
#ASSERT `a court will admit the assurance as evidence of title` `an unregistered mortgage registered under the 1886 Ordinance`
#ASSERT NOT `an unregistered assurance is void`

